256
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,899
I just put her to sleep with magic.

257
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:34,845
Now please, escort her to the
dorm and hide there until morning.

258
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:38,594
Promise you won't leave the
room no matter what happens.

259
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:42,200
Tonight, the protesters will
break down the school gate

260
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:43,690
What?

261
00:13:43,773 --> 00:13:45,880
Wait, you know something, don't you?

262
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:50,900
Tell me what's going on Lene,
you love Miss Claire, right?

263
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,097
Why would you ever doubt that?

264
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:56,356
I've been in her service for
much longer than you have

265
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:00,320
Good, then I'll leave her to you.

266
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,894
I'm trusting you to do the right thing!

267
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,240
Ray, wait.

268
00:14:29,180 --> 00:14:34,020
The soldiers just went down, not sure
what happened, but this is our chance?

269
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:41,530
Captain!

270
00:14:41,613 --> 00:14:43,756
The protestors have reached the gate!

271
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:46,717
Cooperate with the military
and try to quiet the mob!

272
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:49,565
We must protect the
academy no matter the cost!

273
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:50,960
Where are the doors?

274
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:53,877
That noble is gonna get
what's coming to him!

275
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,980
Stop right there! Huh?

276
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:59,000
This is an order from your future king!

277
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,600
Do not take a single step closer!

278
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:19,397
What you're wasting time
I destroyed that bell

279
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:22,660
of yours now you have no
way to control monsters?

280
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:31,780
It was a clever invention but you'll
never get to use it Master Lambert

281
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,457
Hold on. Ray Taylor?

282
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:44,370
How did...

283
00:15:44,453 --> 00:15:46,000
What are you doing here?

284
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,957
Stopping you before it's too late.

285
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,837
I think you might be confused.

286
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:53,737
I was told about the riot and came here
to protect these priceless magic tools.

287
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:55,137
You can drop the act now.

288
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:57,044
What did you do to Deed's wand?

289
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:59,588
What are you talking about?

290
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:01,560
His wand was fine. I checked.

291
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:03,289
And everyone believed you.

292
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,177
Because you're a magic tool specialist.

293
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:09,580
It's your job to inspect
and maintain all the tools.

294
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:12,577
So it'd be pretty easy for
you to rig Deed's wand to

295
00:16:12,660 --> 00:16:16,189
discharge on its own and to
eliminate evidence of tampering.

296
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:17,535
Child's play, really.

297
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,681
And it wasn't just that incident.

298
00:16:21,020 --> 00:16:25,920
You've been encouraging animosity between
nobles and commoners this whole time.

299
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:29,237
Once the rioters overran the school,

300
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:32,517
you were planning to ring that
bell and make monsters attack.

301
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,430
Am I right?

302
00:16:33,513 --> 00:16:34,440
Or am I right?

303
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:40,848
Well, that's a fascinating hypothesis,
but do you have evidence to back it up?

304
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:42,260
No, none at all.

305
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:46,920
But proof or not, I know everything.

306
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:51,180
For example, I know the commoner
movement means nothing to you.

307
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,997
Let's assume what you're
saying is correct.

308
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:58,060
What sort of motive would
I have to do any of it?

309
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:00,300
He has a point.

310
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:03,917
The kingdom relies on
the Oruso Company for

311
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,177
the mining and distribution
of magic stones.

312
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:09,025
and they've accumulated
massive wealth from it.

313
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:12,997
If they were to dismantle the
system that gave them their riches,

314
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,727
they'd be left with nothing.

315
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:17,900
There's only one reason
he'd take such a risk.

316
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:21,542
They're using Linnaeus as
a hostage, aren't they?

317
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,660
I know about that, too.

318
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:27,461
She's more than just your sister.

319
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:29,760
She's someone you love very much.

320
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:32,380
What does that mean?

321
00:17:32,740 --> 00:17:34,857
Ray Taylor, tell me what you know.

322
00:17:34,940 --> 00:17:38,797
Can you believe that some would say
homosexuality is the forbidden love,

323
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:43,351
but here you are with Lene and she's
your blood sibling and you - Stop it!

324
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:46,120
Don't say another word!

325
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:47,480
Please, Ray!

326
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:50,520
Just stop! Lene, don't!

327
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,200
Don't do it!

328
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:55,191
Promise you won't get in my brother's way!

329
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,377
I don't...

330
00:17:56,460 --> 00:17:59,340
I don't want to hurt
Miss Claire, but I will!

331
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:03,840
It's such a shame, Lene.

332
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:08,060
Master Lambert, please stop this.

333
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:11,067
I promise you I'll do
something to help Lene.

334
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,920
You can.

335
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:14,060
Master Lambert!

336
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,917
You don't know how terrifying he is.

337
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,412
If I fail, you'll kill Lene
without a moment's hesitation.

338
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:20,640
I mean it, Ray!

339
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:27,260
I just can't sleep in peace, can I?

340
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,380
Miss Claire!

341
00:18:31,260 --> 00:18:32,090
Lene?

342
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:38,617
I'm sure I don't know the full story here,

343
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:42,876
but tell me, is it accurate to say
that you two are behind all of this?

344
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,057
Surrender now while you have the chance.

345
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:47,177
I don't care what you were planning to do.

346
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:48,554
This is where it ends.

347
00:18:51,140 --> 00:18:51,970
Is it now?

348
00:18:52,053 --> 00:18:54,080
I'm afraid that won't do it all.

349
00:18:57,700 --> 00:19:01,237
Whatever's going on right now,
it isn't a plotline in the game.

350
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,257
I don't recognize any of this.

351
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:04,340
Who is he?

352
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:08,960
Now, Lambert, be a good
boy and call the monster.

353
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,980
The bell is broken.

354
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:12,460
Not a problem.

355
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:16,900
All better now.

356
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:20,777
As long as you hold up
your end of the bargain,

357
00:19:20,860 --> 00:19:23,597
I'll help you escape the
country as I promised.

358
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:27,504
Then you and your sister can live
a new life with new identities.

359
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:31,448
You two could finally have the
life you've always dreamed of.

360
00:19:31,780 --> 00:19:32,760
Go on.

361
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,100
Lambert, wait!

362
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,897
You don't have to do this!

363
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:39,877
You want that freedom, don't you?

364
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:43,195
What would it be like not to
hide your love any longer?

365
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:47,640
I'm sorry, Miss Claire.

366
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:48,999
Please forgive me.

367
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:50,780
But it's too late.

368
00:19:51,180 --> 00:19:52,820
We can't go back now!

369
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:13,297
Is that a chimera?

370
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:14,477
I'm waiting.

371
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:17,257
Chimera!

372
00:20:17,340 --> 00:20:19,920
I command you to eliminate the nobles!

373
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:27,557
Come on, Miss Claire.

374
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,557
We need backup.

375
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,997
Let's go find the guards.

376
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,517
No.

377
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:33,480
What do you mean? No.

378
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:39,021
Retreating may mean more casualties and
harsher punishment for Linnaeus and Lambert.

379
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:41,102
We'll just have to hold it here.

380
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:43,145
Linnaeus is my responsibility.

381
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:45,400
She belongs to me!

382
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:52,617
Responsibility, let's call it that.

383
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:54,053
You're such a tsundere!

384
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:58,360
What on earth is a
tsundere and why am I one?

385
00:20:58,580 --> 00:21:00,217
We're at a disadvantage in here.

386
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:01,577
We need to go somewhere else.

387
00:21:01,660 --> 00:21:03,425
You just blatantly ignored me!

388
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,220
Ms. Clare!

389
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,900
And she sticks to landing!

390
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:36,080
Sub-Zero, freeze!

391
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:47,137
Those magic skills of yours
are completely ridiculous.

392
00:21:47,220 --> 00:21:50,817
There's no magic too ridiculous
for a lady ridiculously in love.

393
00:21:50,900 --> 00:21:51,730
Really? Now?

394
00:21:55,060 --> 00:21:57,080
It possesses multiple attributes.

395
00:21:57,300 --> 00:22:00,840
A head of fire, a body of
earth, and a tail of water.

396
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:04,959
I'm guessing it'll break
out of the ice pretty soon.

397
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:07,972
Do you know what that means, Miss Claire?

398
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:13,420
You and I are about to undertake
our first Herculean labor of love.

399
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:14,950
Haha!

400
00:22:30,840 --> 00:22:35,040
You can't believe I'm so happy.

401
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:38,617
I want you to be just happy.

402
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:41,317
I'm not sure if I want you.

403
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,157
You can't believe I'm excellent.

404
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:46,897
I want you to be happy.
I want you to be a joy.

405
00:22:46,980 --> 00:22:50,417
I want you to be beautiful. I
want you to reach the words.

406
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:56,040
I want you to be so happy?

407
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,117
Thank you

408
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:20,200
so

409
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:26,550
much for watching.

410
00:23:26,633 --> 00:23:27,463
It's like that.

411
00:23:27,546 --> 00:23:30,917
It's not a bad thing, so...

412
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,720
Because when I see my soul,
I won't be able to meet.

413
00:23:35,540 --> 00:23:37,280
I'll be back with it.

414
00:23:38,700 --> 00:23:43,100
I can't see how it will be.

415
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:59,840
Yes, as long as I have you,
nothing can scare me. Good.

416
00:24:00,220 --> 00:24:01,338
Then let's do this.
